-- The seven image apps of the 2026-10-24 provider proposal, all disabled: an Admin switches them on in Settings. One row per feature, so each app is enabled on its own;
-- Character Swap and Model Swap are two rows of the same Nano Banana Pro endpoint. Ratios come from each fal input schema (sources); max_images is the number of input images the app takes;
-- the prices are per image from the provider proposal. Upscale is billed per output image by size (USD 0.08 up to 24 MP) and the adapter keeps every output within 24 MP, so both its keys cost 0.08.
-- Every other app has one price, filed under 1K because an image job always names a resolution.
